  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">STP Kollektivtrafikreform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STP Public transport refo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Swedish consultant team in cooperation with a sub-contracted Russian consultant team will act as a advisory group to the Transport Committee of St Petersburg, with the objective to evaluate alternative policies for the reform process of public transport in general and Gorelektrotrans in particular(tramway/trolleybus systems)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reformering av kollektivtrafiken i St Petersburg. En svensk  konsultgrupp (Contrans AB) i samarbete med en rysk konsultgrupp, kommer att agera r&#xe5;dgivare till St Petersburgs Transportkommitt&#xe9; vg utarbetandet av ett reformprogram f&#xf6;r kollektivtrafiken generellt och f&#xf6;r det kommunala bolaget Gerelektrotrans speciellt(=sp&#xe5;rvagnsystem).</narrative>
  </description>
